    <string name="consent_youtube_withdraw_body_full">This withdraws your consent and clears YouTube\'s cookies and site data and saved video details from Pane. Data Google already holds is not affected. Your stars, notes and tags stay. Pane asks again the next time you open a YouTube link.</string>
    <string name="consent_youtube_withdraw_body_partial">This withdraws your consent and clears YouTube\'s cookies and most site data and saved video details from Pane. Data Google already holds is not affected. Your stars, notes and tags stay. Pane asks again the next time you open a YouTube link.</string>
    <string name="consent_tiktok_withdraw_body_full">This withdraws your consent and clears TikTok\'s cookies and site data and saved TikTok details from Pane. Your stars, notes and tags stay. Pane asks again the next time you open a TikTok link.</string>
    <string name="consent_tiktok_withdraw_body_partial">This withdraws your consent and clears TikTok\'s cookies and most site data and saved TikTok details from Pane. Your stars, notes and tags stay. Pane asks again the next time you open a TikTok link.</string>
    <string name="consent_instagram_withdraw_body_full">This withdraws your consent and clears Instagram\'s cookies and site data from Pane. Your stars, notes and tags stay. Pane asks again the next time it needs Instagram\'s embed.</string>
    <string name="consent_instagram_withdraw_body_partial">This withdraws your consent and clears Instagram\'s cookies and most site data from Pane. Your stars, notes and tags stay. Pane asks again the next time it needs Instagram\'s embed.</string>
